一个月饼的相思 · A Mooncake's Longing — Paper-cut Lightbox (Lemo-Opuscar demo)
LemoLab × Claude Opus 5.5

All paper layers, figures, props, calligraphy layouts and the lightbox are drawn by code in this folder
(Canvas2D paper layers + three.js renderer). No photos or AI-generated images inside the box.
Story, script and shot design are original.

