Voice: Microsoft Edge neural TTS voice zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural, generated with the open-source edge-tts client
(github.com/rany2/edge-tts).
LICENCE EXCEPTION: this voice track (the narration in paper-lantern.mp4) is NOT covered by the library's CC BY 4.0
licence for demo films; Microsoft's terms for redistributing Edge TTS audio are unclear. We plan to re-voice it with
Kokoro (core/tts/). In your own film, use Kokoro or a voice you have the right to use, never this track.
Speech check / word timings: faster-whisper (MIT) with the Systran faster-whisper-medium model (MIT).
Sound effects: synthesized in mix.py (no samples).

Texts quoted: 苏轼《水调歌头·明月几时有》(Song dynasty); 田汝成《西湖游览志余》(Ming dynasty) — public domain.

